# Briefing text for the generated Cobra site missions (the engine shows <deployment>_BRIEFING).
# BUILD, 12 Nov: placeholder until STORY writes mission briefings. Plain, in Hawk's register, no story claims.
extraStrings:
  - type: en-US
    strings:
      STR_COBRA_BROADCAST_STATION_SITE_BRIEFING: "Intelligence has traced Cobra's pirate broadcasts to this site. Take the transmitter off the air, capture any Cobra personnel you can, and recover their equipment and recordings for analysis."
      STR_COBRA_DEPOT_SITE_BRIEFING: "This is a Cobra supply depot. Weapons and materiel pass through here to their cells. Neutralise the guard force and secure everything in the stores. What we recover, Cobra loses."
      STR_COBRA_FACTORY_SITE_BRIEFING: "Cobra is building weapons and equipment at this facility. Expect a heavier garrison. Clear the site, take prisoners where you can, and recover any hardware for the lab."
      STR_COBRA_FRONT_COMPANY_SITE_BRIEFING: "This legitimate-looking business is a Cobra front. Its money and paperwork keep their operations running. Go in, neutralise the hostiles, and bring back anyone and anything that can tell us who they answer to."
      STR_COBRA_HIDDEN_HQ_SITE_BRIEFING: "We have located a Cobra regional headquarters. Their commanders and records are here. This will be defended hard. Take it, and take its officers alive if you can."
      STR_COBRA_RESEARCH_LAB_SITE_BRIEFING: "Cobra scientists are working at this site. Find out what they are building, stop it, and bring back the scientists and their work."
      STR_COBRA_TERROR_DROME_SITE_BRIEFING: "This is a Terror Drome, Cobra's fortified base of operations in the region. It is heavily defended. Destroy the garrison and secure the base."
      STR_COBRA_TRAINING_CAMP_SITE_BRIEFING: "Cobra is training new troops at this camp. Shut it down. Every recruit stopped here is one fewer in the field."
